| ZeroCopy: the three clips with every picture checked as held in vcdec's
| own buffer (-Z: not copied out), then hd holding 4 at a time in 6
| buffers (-H 4 -B 6), to the end and a seek after it, closing with
| pictures still held. Reports to ResultZ.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultZ
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -Z -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultZ <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -Z -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultZ <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -Z -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultZ <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -H 4 -B 6 -E -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultZ <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
